text I wake up to the sound of birdsong.
text Upon opening my eyes, a bright blue sky fills my vision.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...?
text My bed feels prickly and cold.
text I feel around and find nothing but wet grass.
text Why was I sleeping here?
text That's right. I'm in Kotomi's garden.
text I feel like I was dreaming.
text That was...
if intF[416] == 7
	goto s2
fi
goto 3
label s2
text I start to get up and notice my jacket spread across my stomach.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh yeah...
text I'm starting to remember.
text After digging up the soil in the flower bed, I sat down and rolled over onto my side to rest.
text And after that, I...
text I...
text @[Tomoya]
text ??
text My memory is failing me.
text I was on the ground and I was cold, so I went to... grab my jacket?
text @[Tomoya]
text ???
label 3
text The tail of the dream slips through my grasp just as I'm about to catch it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh well.
text I let out a big yawn and stretch.
text Despite having slept outdoors, I feel rested.
text I squint in the morning sun as I look up at Kotomi's house.
text As usual, it looks deserted.
text @[Tomoya]
text Good morning, Kotomi.
text Then I look around at the garden; a work in progress.
text I really need to finish it up today.
text @[Tomoya]
text Time to get started.
text I stand up.
