text My first job of the day is to trim the garden trees.
text Referencing the book I bought yesterday, I start by using the hedge clippers.
text The trees don't come out as nicely as if a pro had done it, but they look much different with shorter branches.
text After trimming down the branches that were sticking out, more light is getting through to the garden.
text I can hear some kids, maybe in kindergarten or elementary school, chatting on their way to school.
text I hear the noise of a truck engine pull up near the hedge.
text I put down the clippers and head to the front.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG050B"
