text Just as I thought, it's a truck bearing the hardware store's logo.
text A tall guy I assume to be the driver is looking at the nameplate in front of the house.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hello.
sound E5O.aac
text @[Driver]
text You are... Okazaki-san, correct?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, that's right.
text My name is different from the one on the nameplate, which explains his confusion.
sound E5P.aac
text @[Driver]
text I'm here to deliver the stuff you purchased yesterday.
text @[Tomoya]
text Can you drop them off inside the gate? I'll carry them the rest of the way.
