text I got lost.
text It's because the usual field I played at became off-limits for some reason.
text All the neighborhood kids started looking for a new place to play.
text Before I knew it, I was all alone.
text I was in an unfamiliar residential area.
text As a child, it felt like I was in another country.
text Feeling dusk creeping up behind me, I walked faster.
text Just as I was on the verge of running...
text I heard a strange noise coming from behind a tall hedge.
text It was a noise I'd never heard before.
text But it felt nostalgic for some reason.
text Drawn by the noise, I looked for a way past the hedge.
text I found an opening in the leaves and stiff branches and pushed my way through.
