text It was a beautiful garden.
text Uniformly cut grass, a bright white patio set.
text The flower bed was overflowing with flowers whose names I didn't know.
text Even the dusk couldn't enter that place.
text It struck me as a special place that would forever remain unchanged.
text As I was about to turn around to bring everyone else there...
text I saw a girl I didn't know.
text She was staring at me while holding a violin and bow.
text After we exchanged a few words, she awkwardly smiled at me.
text She and I became friends.
