sound E72.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll have a birthday party soon.
text She told me that with the setting sun shining on her cheeks.
text We were tired from playing and were sitting down, looking out at the garden.
sound E73.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I want you to come, Tomoya-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text How many people will be there?
text I didn't want to meet people I didn't know.
sound E74.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text There will be four people.
text She said that proudly.
sound E75.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, me, Mommy, and...
text @[Tomoya]
text Who's the last one?
sound E76.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy.
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't call that a party.
text I told her that, secretly feeling relieved.
sound E77.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text ?
text @[Tomoya]
text Parties have lots more people.
text She started looking sad after I said that.
sound E78.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Oh...
sound E79.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But it's still a birthday party.
sound E7A.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy said he'll give me a giant teddy bear.
sound E7B.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy said she'll make us a huge feast.
sound E7C.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I have to go home soon.
text It was getting dark out, and I stood up.
text Maybe it was because I felt envious as she spoke so proudly of her parents.
text I put on my shoes and socks, then walked across the garden.
sound E7D.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, see you tomorrow.
text She said that to me as usual.
text @[Tomoya]
text I might not come tomorrow.
text And just as usual, that's how I responded.
text She looked straight at me and seemed to be thinking about something.
sound E7E.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text You don't have to come tomorrow.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
text That was the first time she said something like that.
sound E7F.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll try to be okay even if you don't come tomorrow.
sound E7G.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But please, please come to my birthday party.
sound E7H.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text You really, really have to.
sound E7I.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be waiting for you.
sound E7J.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be waiting...
