delay 60
text I thought to myself that I'd better give her a present.
text Her birthday.
text I didn't have anything she would like, and I couldn't buy her anything.
text I decided to bring her some friends.
text She might be happy even if I were the only one there.
text Even if I came alone, I could celebrate with her even if I didn't bring a present.
text But I had to do something for her.
text I went around to all the girls in the neighborhood.
text I told them about a beautiful garden, delicious sweets, and a slightly strange girl.
text I invited them to a birthday party that was coming up.
text The girls all smiled, albeit a little uneasily, but none of them agreed to go.
text I told my usual friends.
text They teased me because I was "playing with girls."
text I went all over, talking to anyone I knew. Everyone turned me down.
text After my very last friend declined, I realized that the sun had already set.
text I figured her birthday party would already be over.
text I was too ashamed to face her.
text With heavy feet, I walked home.
text Tears welled up in my eyes at the sounds of my lonely footsteps.
text I really liked her.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
