if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text The tattered clouds are dyed red and reflect in Kotomi's eyes.
text Kotomi stays that way for a while.
text It's like she just remembered that the sky is there.
text The outside world.
text The vast sky that appears to stretch forever.
text An unknown future awaits us out there.
sound EA6.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The sky is so pretty.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's pretty.
text I smile at Kotomi.
text I smile at the person I will be with from now on.
text Even if you can't see me, I can see you.
text Even if we can't meet, I will always be by your side.
text Until the day we part...
text In this moment, at least... in this world...
text I can feel Kotomi, and Kotomi can feel me.
delay 60
delay 60
music ~
